    91	
    92	| Responsibility | Manager | Subagent |
    93	|---|---|---|
    94	| Issue | Creates or picks up; labels; closes (when needed) | Never touches |
    95	| Worktree | Creates before delegation, removes after merge | Works within (cd to path first) |
    96	| Branch | Names and creates locally | Commits to it |
